  "voice_menu": "1177, vårdcentraler, Försäkringskassan, Skatteverket, banks and operators (Telia, Tele2, Telenor) use IVR, often with callback offers instead of holding.",
  "callback_habits": "Vårdcentraler use callback queues (återuppringning) instead of holding; booking systems send SMS/email reminders; small businesses reply by SMS.",
